PlayStation 2 core — LRPS2
- LRPS2, the libretro PlayStation 2 core, derived from PCSX2 (PCSX2 Team and contributors).
  Source: https://github.com/libretro/ps2 — licence GPL-3.0 (COPYING.GPLv3 in that repository).
- Binary: libretro buildbot nightly for Android arm64-v8a,
  https://buildbot.libretro.com/nightly/android/latest/arm64-v8a/pcsx2_libretro_android.so.zip
  (buildbot file dated Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:58:08 GMT). Shipped as lib/arm64-v8a/liblrps2_libretro.so, unmodified.
  SHA-256 of the extracted library: 7fbc421819bade622e04886b1ddb84b0cfdb9bc7a7ad97fdcee824ff82a4df06
- Source commit: the buildbot binary does not record its commit. By build time it is libretro/ps2 master at
  e0d67a29c4eefa1097a59a0ab30d9491c02ce4d7 (committed 2026-11-15 22:30 UTC) or the commit just before it,
  4480355068686cdd174ca57c556693332d0b2646 (2026-11-15 20:15 UTC). This is inferred from timestamps. The
  corresponding source is public at https://github.com/libretro/ps2 and can also be requested from the
